ZCL_MODULE_CAPABILITY("tools/command/native_mesh_terminal_hub_connect.c", CAP_FS_READ|CAP_FS_WRITE|CAP_NETWORK|CAP_PROCESS|CAP_CLOCK|CAP_PRIVILEGE, "Reads the 0600 terminal key file, connects to 127.0.0.1 or runs this executable's device-host client on a socket pair, writes the tunnel pipes and the caller's terminal, and changes termios only on the caller's stdin; the raw pidfd_open syscall is a bounded wait on the tunnel child and acquires no privilege (CAP_PRIVILEGE is declared only because the closure checker classes any raw syscall as privileged)")
